    {
      "id": "claim_8e7b1dab8f93492abced8b26fab42a63",
      "statement": "server() registers each packed operation with the FastMCP 3 direct-function form mcp.tool(fn, name=operation.name, description=operation.description, tags={operation.layer}), so the MCP tool name is the DTO class name (the bus key), the tool description is the introspection-resolved instruction an agent reads on tools/list, and the tag is the layer 'features' or 'app_services'.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://sincpro_framework/entrypoints/const.py#L5-L11",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:4de21352f8c9f8c7059d4f6e6b977b70ffa47fb04459648ee2759c97095feb6f:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://sincpro_framework/entrypoints/mcp/entrypoint.py#L55-L61",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:64dca63a6e71e650aff897ed8dda9f73bfe1789b25a1074490339da001732da6:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://sincpro_framework/introspection/inspector.py#L52-L69",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:4f42d3114700c1193de1ea8ad0f58aadc5e3e38817960a816205a2ffacb23967:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_f5bd3796781847608749fabb0fac150f",
      "statement": "The FastMCP host and the in-process accessors publish different sets: server() and build_mcp_server() ask the catalog for get_scalar_use_cases(filter_binaries_schema=True), which drops DTOs that cannot travel as JSON with a warning, whereas tools() and to_callables() call get_scalar_use_cases() with the default filter disabled and therefore still list those operations.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://sincpro_framework/entrypoints/catalog.py#L116-L156",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:6e61044a76b425d0fe25c897a6d673cf44ae5de0e9f709f668dcf417dcd0e703:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://sincpro_framework/entrypoints/mcp/entrypoint.py#L33-L39",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:55d8f41ac21574fcdefe1a6390a20828eff4cf89079fc5074500dcec05fb67ff:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://sincpro_framework/entrypoints/mcp/entrypoint.py#L55-L55",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:a0f407dbf9ee3bc3d1351d5040925ca62d7a012d8557547b21b0386979402adc:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_a865ed6c95054c53bb759e740d84c68d",
      "statement": "fastmcp_callable(operation) returns a plain function that forwards its keyword arguments as one payload dict to operation.run, and stamps FastMCP-visible identity onto it: __name__ from operation.name, __doc__ from operation.description, __annotations__ with the DTO field types plus a dict return, and __signature__ built from inspect.Parameter objects. Nothing in it imports FastMCP, so it is testable standalone.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://sincpro_framework/entrypoints/mcp/mcp.py#L13-L28",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:4badc6d67a193f5643835227e21dfa44b2abfc65b7915444f48f94d0382aef16:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://sincpro_framework/entrypoints/mcp/mcp.py#L50-L53",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:749514bffbb98b9d28be4e8f2668fbca97a314e0cf4e5136deb0284052eaba71:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://tests/entrypoint/test_entrypoints.py#L239-L250",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:88cefb55f98c9175c5e3b68c02255778b2cdb8ef3ae47aad667a3f88d07c6734:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_89916ff8ed5e4befb60d389ec04e50de",
      "statement": "fastmcp_callable flattens the DTO: each DTO field becomes a KEYWORD_ONLY parameter of the same name carrying the pydantic field annotation, so FastMCP sees Value Objects, Field descriptions, unions and enums rather than a single nested wrapper parameter typed as the DTO.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://sincpro_framework/entrypoints/mcp/mcp.py#L30-L49",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:51604deb089c2560498818ce5244b118d3d480a737f3aa298842cef22a78ab4e:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://tests/entrypoint/test_entrypoints.py#L242-L250",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:d9cf232b9263b7fe4cbf339fc94e6cc14c4af3276b002af76ef06de60c8bdf62:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_795f378357304823b9d770b80d02c6db",
      "statement": "In the stamped signature a required DTO field gets no default (inspect.Parameter.empty), an ordinary optional field keeps the pydantic default value, and a field declared with default_factory travels as Annotated[annotation, Field(default_factory=...)] metadata with an empty parameter default — so the factory stays callable and runs per call instead of freezing uuid4/datetime.now at import time, while the field is still not required in the published schema.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://sincpro_framework/entrypoints/mcp/mcp.py#L34-L49",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:dbf921ac6fc6b430e04a085d6004d5fe9b9361ad5e924ba9e0822576d5195c09:"
        },
        {
