    },
    {
      "id": "claim_a958001ef9ae410d96564fe44cd90e39",
      "statement": "include/exclude/wrap on Entrypoint do not build anything: they delegate to the same-named Catalog methods and return self, which is what lets policies chain before server()/run() is called, and they are the supported place for authorization, auditing or extra logging because no FastMCP type or transport flag is allowed on Feature or ApplicationService.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://docs/architecture/entrypoint_mcp.md#L196-L206",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:dd09b77c3df8b7c413834bba0f079b3850c6e1e97b5620fa48aa5bb8b83c358b:"
        },
