    {
      "id": "claim_de75c85141d34d4191a33f1f91c336ac",
      "statement": "The FastMCP-specific code is confined to the mcp subpackage: sincpro_framework/entrypoints/__init__.py re-exports only the protocol-agnostic Catalog and PackedFeatureOrAppService, while Entrypoint and build_mcp_server are re-exported from sincpro_framework/entrypoints/mcp/__init__.py without implementation.",
